circle\">17</div><div class=\"circle\">18</div><div class=\"circle\">19</div><div class=\"circle\">20</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-title\">\n                <div class=\"title-left\">\n                    <span class=\"title-label\">Title</span>\n                    <span class=\"main-title\">人民日报金句—清正廉洁篇</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"date-right\">\n                    <span class=\"date-label\">Date</span>\n                    <span class=\"date-value\">05.30</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"list-container\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">1、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">心在正中，不存邪念，是为“忠”；言而能成，不搞虚假，则为“诚”。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">2、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">要从一开始就扣好人生的扣子，常怀<span class=\"red-box\">感恩之心、敬畏之心、律己之心，</span>常用真善美来雕琢自己，在清廉自守中正心修身、矢志图强。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">3、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">要树立“君子固穷”的清正意识，以<span class=\"red-box\">“澄江静如练”</span>的淡泊与坦然除去心灵的“杂草”；要摒弃养尊处优的<span class=\"red-box\">“小九九”</span>、摧毁徇私谋利的<span class=\"red-box\">“小山头”</span>。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">4、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">要涵养廉洁自律的道德修为，<span class=\"red-box\">心有所畏、言有所戒、行有所止，</span>不断锤炼<span class=\"red-box\">意志力、坚忍力、自制力，</span>做一个<span class=\"red-box\">一心为公、一身正气、一尘不染</span>的人。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">5、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">青年干部要扣好人生第一粒扣子，坚持吾日三省，在思想上多照<span class=\"red-box\">“镜子”</span>、勤清洗<span class=\"red-box\">“灰尘”</span>、去除<span class=\"red-box\">“杂质”</span>，自觉同上级要求“对标”，拿党章党规“扫描”，用人民期待“透视”。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">6、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">“尽小者大，慎微者著”，青年干部要牢记“堤溃蚁孔，气泄针芒”的古训，从日常点滴做起，从一言一行做起。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">7、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">要常怀敬畏之心，自觉防微杜渐，<span class=\"red-box\">远离“高压线”、不逾“红线”、坚守“底线”</span>，把家风建设摆在重要位置，持之以恒<span class=\"red-box\">净化“生活圈、交往圈、娱乐圈”</span>。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-number\">8、</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\">\n                        <span class=\"pink-bg\">欲知平直，则必准绳；欲知方圆，则必规矩。无以规矩不成方圆，纪律是衡量D员干部行为的尺子，把纪律当耳旁风必然要付出代价。</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-text\">Designed by Dazai</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
